{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2021-04-07 16:15:00', 'title': 'CITY OF COLUMBUS, GEORGIA MOVING TO AUTOMATED TRASH COLLECTION WITH THE HELP OF ENVIRONMENTAL SOLUTIONS GROUP', 'text': "DOWNERS GROVE, ILL., APRIL 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ENVIRONMENTAL SOLUTIONS GROUP (ESG), PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE CITY OF COLUMBUS, GEORGIA IS IN THE PROCESS OF STREAMLINING ITS REFUSE COLLECTION PROGRAMS AND IS LOOKING TO ESG'S HEIL® FOR NEW DURAPACK® PYTHON® AUTOMATED SIDE LOADERS TO HELP INCREASE EFFICIENCIES RELATED TO THE CITY'S RECYCLING PROGRAM."}